      "content": "but it's more than just stress. i can feel it happening. it's like a slow erasure. i'm watching my own mind get smaller and smaller every single day. i just don't want to wait until i'm a total stranger to myself. i don't want to be the person that everyone has to \"deal with\" or pity because i can't even remember how to brush my teeth or who they are. i'd rather leave while i can still at least say goodbye, you know? before the dignity is just... gone.",
